Description: Add a comm Name column and configurable text widths
 Process names now come from /proc/<pid>/comm, with the historic stat
 comm field as a fallback for older captures. --name-width, --cmd-width,
 --user-width, and --mapping-width set those columns; 0 prints the full
 value and a positive width is not overridden by --autosize.
 Behavior adapted from G-dH/smem and the smem2 rewrite.
Origin: https://github.com/G-dH/smem
Forwarded: no
Author: Hualet Wang <mr.asianwang@gmail.com>

