 .TP
 .BI "\-c " COLUMNS ", \-\-columns=" COLUMNS
 Columns to show.
+The process listing accepts a
+.B name
+column, the process name from
+.I /proc/<pid>/comm
+(falling back to the comm field in
+.I /proc/<pid>/stat
+when comm is unavailable).
+
+.TP
+.BI "\-\-name-width=" N
+Width of the Name column.
+.B 0
+shows the name in full.
+The default width is 15.
+
+.TP
+.BI "\-\-cmd-width=" N
+Width of the Command column.
+.B 0
+shows the command in full.
+The default width is 27.
+
+.TP
+.BI "\-\-user-width=" N
+Width of the User column.
+.B 0
+shows the user name in full.
+The default width is 8.
+
+.TP
+.BI "\-\-mapping-width=" N
+Width of the Map column.
+.B 0
+shows the mapping name in full.
+The default width is 40.
 
 .TP
 .B \-H, \-\-no\-header
